So you want to know how to measure the weight of an item ingame with no
spiolers. Well it's actualy fairly easy. Put the item down, now pick up
enough gold to put you into a burdened state. Now drop your gold 1
piece at a time until you are no longer burdened. Pick up the item now,
and you should go into a burdened state (or worse). Now drop your gold
in parts until you are have just left your burdened state, and you'll
then know the exact weight of the item.

(I suggest doing this while wearing gauntlets of strength, and when all
you have in your inventory is your gold and the object in question)


